# Inventory of D: repos to mirror to the NAS.
#
# One repo folder name per line, resolved under -LocalBase (default D:\).
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored; inline text after # is stripped.
#
# Prefix a line with '+' to mark it load-bearing core (kept fully local as the
# offline fallback). Everything else becomes NAS-only. No core is marked yet —
# fill these in before running with -Prune, or the run keeps every local copy.
#
# The sync script warns and skips any name it can't find on disk rather than
# failing the whole run, so a stray typo is non-fatal.

